Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.90,0:20:50.04,Insert_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur7\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&}離別總是突如其來地降臨
Dialogue: 1,0:20:50.04,0:20:56.21,Insert_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur7\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&}你怎會明白被遺落的心情
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.87,0:21:02.20,Insert_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur7\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&}在習以為常的日子裡
